{"3648340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Field of Enemies", "steam_appid": 3648340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4082830], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648340/extras/05b44fe33c72de8d79674515373a7cf2.poster.avif?t=1763397239\" width=354 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648340/extras/05b44fe33c72de8d79674515373a7cf2.webm?t=1763397239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive, Upgrade, Become a Legend!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the chaotic and fun Low Poly world of &quot;Field of Enemies&quot;! This is a casual top-down action roguelike where you'll face endless hordes of enemies, from clumsy zombies to advanced robots. Your goal is simple: survive as long as you can, surrounding yourself with a literal hellscape of monsters, and etch your name into the history of the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or team up with friends – co-op for up to 4 players turns survival into an incredibly fun and crazy battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648340/extras/13585c28fa73e2ef1acd280d2a0caa2c.apng?t=1763397239\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648340/extras/13585c28fa73e2ef1acd280d2a0caa2c.poster.avif?t=1763397239\" class=\"bb_img\" width=842 height=12 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why players will love Field of Enemies:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Fights 